 | `cutlass_w4a8` | `CutlassW4A8Config` | `INT4×FP8PerTensor` | `SwiGLU`, `SwiGLUStep`, `GeGLU`, `GeGLUTanh`, `ReLU2`, `SiTU`, `Identity`, `GELU`, `ReLU`, `SiLU` |
